<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!-- SDK-authored parity fixture: the default values of the constraints, each addressed by one of the placements the compile step names: a path that opens with the definition's archetype id, one that opens with a slash, a name predicate written with a comma and one written with and name/value, a predicate broken across lines, and a constraint object that names no RM type, which takes its default value's. -->
